WEBVTT

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:07.590
Yuya, Yuzu, Sora, Tatsuya, Ayu and Futoshi.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.820
The day has finally come!

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:15.560
Every You Show School student managed 
to enter the Maiami Championship.

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:20.770
I am so proud of you all!

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.380
Why did you dodge me?

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:31.740
Dad, you're too fired up.

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:34.680
We're not even at the arena yet.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:37.220
You're right.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:40.920
I'll explain again.

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:47.680
The Maiami Championship is separated into 
three classes: Junior, Junior Youth and Youth.

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:50.320
Tatsuya, Ayu and Futoshi are in Junior Class.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:51.360
Right!

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:55.540
Yuya, Yuzu and Sora are 
in Junior Youth Class.

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:56.460
Right!

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:02.410
You probably know this, but Maiami City's 
duel schools aren't the only ones

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:05.680
participating in LDS's Maiami Championship.

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:11.960
Powerful duelists from all around 
Japan - no, the world - will enter!

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:16.840
To spread the appeal of You Show 
School's entertainment dueling,

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:19.360
you must all try to win the championship!

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:24.520
Starting now, you're not only teammates 
that have studied together,

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:26.570
but you're also rivals!

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.920
Battle with all your strength!

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:31.200
Don't get perplexed!  Have no regrets!

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:34.280
Trust everything you 
learned and get fired up!

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:36.270
My blood is boiling!

00:01:44.060 --> 00:01:44.940
All right!

00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:45.800
I'll try my best!

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:47.550
I'll make everyone get shivers!

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:51.020
I promise to win!

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:53.400
Okay, everyone.  Are you ready?

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:54.490
Yeah!

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:56.000
Then let's go!

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:58.260
Engine, get fired up and go!

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:05.680
What is it, Yuzu?

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:07.970
Dad, Yuya!

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:09.480
Yuya?

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:13.060
He's missing!

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:15.600
What?

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:22.190
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:27.000
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:30.190
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:34.370
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:53.150
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:56.560
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:05.300
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:09.870
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:12.070
Impulse  Got it got it

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:17.280
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:28.020
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:34.960
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:38.900
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:42.300
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:52.580
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:55.920
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:04:00.020 --> 00:04:05.960
Maiami Championship Begins!!

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:19.580
Look!  Maiami City is full of dueling!

00:04:19.580 --> 00:04:26.510
That's right!  Today is the start of our 
city's biggest event, the Maiami Championship!

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:31.480
Maiami City is the home of Leo Corporation,

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:35.770
the dueling industry's largest company that 
invented the Real Solid Vision System.

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:40.200
This tournament is known as the 
greatest duel tournament in the world,

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:43.370
so many overseas duelists participate.

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:49.530
And many tourists have come to 
Maiami City to watch the battles!

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:55.540
Incredible!  The Duel Stadium is already 
super packed for the opening ceremonies!

00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:00.020
Can that be?

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:02.440
It's Reiji!

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:08.270
Reiji Akaba, the president of the 
tournament's main sponsor Leo Corporation,

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:11.720
has appeared in the VIP seats!

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:15.190
Reiji!

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:21.430
It's rare that we get to see 
Reiji live and in person!

00:05:21.430 --> 00:05:27.370
Reiji!  Reiji!  Reiji!

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:30.700
This is my first time seeing Reiji Akaba.

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:34.480
Because he rarely shows himself in public.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:37.740
Yeah.  He's a living legend.

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:42.440
He won the Junior, Junior 
Youth and Youth Tournaments.

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:47.060
Then he qualified for the pros when 
he was 15 years old.  He's a genius.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.260
Well?

00:05:54.260 --> 00:05:56.840
I couldn't find him!  He's not here!

00:05:56.840 --> 00:05:59.400
What happened to Yuya?

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:02.840
I understand.  Keep searching!

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:06.980
Yuya, what's up with you?

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:11.820
Sora, have you seen Yuya?

00:06:11.820 --> 00:06:14.280
No.  He's not here yet.

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:16.840
Yuzu, what should we do?

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:21.520
I called his house, but he didn't 
go home.  I can't reach him.

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:24.160
Where did Yuya go?

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:25.520
What?

00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:28.720
You're...

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:31.670
My darling isn't here?

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:34.540
Your darling?

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:37.140
Yuzu?

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:44.740
Maybe my darling secretly went 
to talk to Mieru's Papa and Mama!

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:47.120
What a surprise!

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:50.000
What are you talking about?  That's not true!

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:52.320
Yuzu, please calm down!

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:53.960
But what should we do?

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:56.300
It's almost time for the opening ceremonies.

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:57.920
Don't worry!

00:06:57.920 --> 00:07:02.050
Mieru can use her fortunetelling to 
quickly find her darling's location!

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:08.910
Darling, where are you?

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:12.660
Darling!  My darling!

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:14.040
I see him!

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:17.160
Where is he?

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:18.580
Over there!

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:20.420
Over there?

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:22.550
Like I said!

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:25.160
Over there!

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:39.670
Dad, the tournament where I can get 
closer to you is finally about to start.

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:45.260
Your next challenger Strong 
Ishijima is really strong, right?

00:07:45.260 --> 00:07:47.940
Yeah.  But don't worry.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:51.320
No matter how powerful the opponent, 
your dad will battle with all his might!

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:54.960
So Yuya, you must also try your 
best in the Junior Tournament.

00:07:55.440 --> 00:07:59.880
Yeah!  I promise to win and 
become a duelist like you, Dad!

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:03.320
Yuya, you're a little wrong.

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:05.920
Don't be like your dad.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:08.900
It's important to preserve your Yuya-ness.

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:14.980
Preserve my uniqueness...

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:19.560
If you don't hurry, you'll be late.

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:21.770
Mom.

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:24.450
Yuzu called me.

00:08:24.860 --> 00:08:27.900
Everyone is worried because you're missing.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:34.240
Mom, I...

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:38.980
Yuya.

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:41.970
You're at the wrong place.

00:08:43.360 --> 00:08:47.400
If you want to say something to your 
dad, then you shouldn't be here.

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:48.940
You have to go there.

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:55.880
The stadium...

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:05.100
I heard Yuya Sakaki ran away.

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:06.930
What?  Like father, like son.

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:10.730
Yuzu, what should we do?

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:12.940
Yuya...

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:15.520
There you are!

00:09:16.420 --> 00:09:18.170
Hey!

00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:20.410
Yuzu!  Everyone!

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:22.110
Yuya!

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:24.400
Yuya...

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:27.320
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:28.280
Yuya!

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:31.480
You made us really worry!  Where were you?

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:34.200
Sorry.  I needed to do something.

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:36.900
We're about to enter, 
right?  Let's get in line.

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:39.190
You're such a...

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:40.560
Now now.

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:47.400
Long time no see, wimp.

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:49.130
You're...

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:57.520
Since this is an important tournament, I 
thought you ran away like your old man.

00:09:57.520 --> 00:09:58.210
What?

00:09:58.520 --> 00:10:03.680
I won't accept that someone like 
you defeated Strong Ishijima.

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:05.140
Who is that?

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:06.440
I don't know.

00:10:07.220 --> 00:10:14.130
Want me to crush you here and now 
to prove that you're a coward?

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:20.000
That's enough, Gen Ankokuji.

00:10:21.940 --> 00:10:23.380
Gongenzaka!

00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:26.410
You're not showing respect 
to your senior teammate.

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:30.000
You must think you're a big shot, Gongenzaka!

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:32.610
You're no longer my senior teammate!

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:38.240
You will be entering soon.

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:42.790
All duelists, please form a line 
behind your team's placard.

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:47.930
You better survive until I can crush you.

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:54.380
I didn't think I would meet him here.

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:56.880
Gongenzaka!

00:10:57.100 --> 00:10:59.340
You're able to participate!

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:04.700
Yeah!  The man Gongenzaka 
barely achieved a 60% win rate

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:06.810
by the registration deadline!

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:11.280
I see!  That's great!

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:22.820
Everyone, sorry to keep you waiting!

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:25.500
It's the annual festival for duelists!

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:28.770
The Maiami Championship will begin!

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:34.240
Nico Smiley will emcee 
the opening ceremonies!

00:11:37.160 --> 00:11:40.680
The duelists will now enter!

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:47.220
The duelists will now enter!

00:11:54.660 --> 00:11:58.360
They've started to enter!

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:02.320
First is LDS - Leo Duel School 
- who incredibly won every class

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:05.140
in last year's tournament!

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:08.800
This famous school turns out 
many pro duelists every year,

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:11.860
and they have the most 
entrants again this year!

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:15.360
That's...

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:17.200
Why is he with LDS?

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:21.120
Next is the main temple 
for martial arts duelists!

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:23.040
It's Ryozanpaku School!

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:28.240
Their ace Isao Kachidoki finished 
second in last year's Junior Youth!

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:31.560
They're burning to defeat LDS this year.

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:36.120
Next is a foreign team from overseas!

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:37.780
Knight of Duels!

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:48.080
Enter the duel tournament?

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.920
That's your condition for dueling you?

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:52.440
That's right.

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:58.660
We will select the best duelists 
there to battle against Leo Akaba.

00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:00.630
Battle against your father?

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:03.520
Leo Akaba is my enemy.

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:07.830
In other words, we are fighting 
against the same enemy.

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:13.500
There will be someone who uses real 
Fusion Summoning in the tournament.

00:13:15.780 --> 00:13:20.780
And there's someone who uses a new summoning 
method that you know nothing about.

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:24.790
I want you to use your eyes and skills

00:13:24.790 --> 00:13:29.300
to determine if they can become 
spears to fight against Leo Akaba.

00:13:34.320 --> 00:13:38.040
Next is Surprise School 
that uses trick dueling!

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:41.800
This school's ace Yuzo Tanegashima is 
the master of the Transformation Deck!

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:44.480
Yuya, you know him too?

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:48.770
Yeah.  He attacked LDS's team in front of me.

00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:56.800
With great applause, it's the Duelie 
Club where pop stars learn to duel!

00:13:56.800 --> 00:14:01.190
Keep your eye on pop idol 
duelist Mikiyo Naname!

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:08.730
Next is the entertainment dueling school that's 
been grabbing the headlines - You Show School!

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:11.260
Yuya, have fun!

00:14:11.260 --> 00:14:15.170
You Show School, fight fight fight!

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:18.410
You Show School's Yuya Sakaki has made news

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:21.340
for using a new summoning method 
known as Pendulum Summon.

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:23.620
He's one to focus on in this tournament.

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:35.820
Ahem.  Those gathered here have defeated 
the top duelists to become the elite.

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:40.790
I hope you duel fair and square 
with all your strength.

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:46.480
Next up is reciting the player's oath.

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:51.000
Representing the players is 
You Show School's Yuya Sakaki!

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:52.970
Me?

00:14:53.180 --> 00:14:53.940
Yuya?

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:55.440
The player's oath?

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:56.410
What?

00:14:56.720 --> 00:14:58.980
Wait a second!  No one told me!

00:14:58.980 --> 00:15:01.780
Yuya Sakaki, come to the stage!

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:06.390
Yuya, if you're a man, then nail it!

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:15.560
Yuya, this is another step in 
becoming an entertainer.  So please.

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:17.180
Yuya...

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:20.480
Well then...

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:26.120
The p-p-player's oath!

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:29.460
Yuya...

00:15:29.460 --> 00:15:30.910
He's too nervous.

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:33.450
Umm...

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:36.320
Yuya, pull yourself together!  
Everyone is watching!

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:39.620
Everyone...

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:44.640
Make everyone smile...

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:50.320
Is Yuya okay?

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:52.680
He's fine.  There's nothing to worry about.

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:04.060
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:05.280
Yuya?

00:16:05.370 --> 00:16:07.900
I apologize for that just now.

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:12.890
I'll start over with the player's 
oath... is what I want to say,

00:16:12.890 --> 00:16:14.920
but please listen to my story instead.

00:16:15.860 --> 00:16:19.660
My dad is the duelist Yusyo Sakaki.

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:22.630
He's the world's greatest 
entertainment duelist.

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:25.660
But as everyone knows,

00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:29.780
he suddenly vanished three years 
ago right before a duel started.

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:34.760
Everyone said that I was the 
kid of a cowardly duelist.

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:38.850
I didn't want to let that defeat me, so 
I worked hard at entertainment dueling.

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:42.550
But somewhere inside, I think I 
was running away from dueling.

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:48.250
But when I encountered Pendulum Summoning 
and battled against powerful duelists,

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:50.960
I gradually enjoyed dueling more.

00:16:51.340 --> 00:16:52.680
Yuya...

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:56.640
I wanted to love dueling even more!

00:16:56.740 --> 00:17:04.340
And I want to become a great pro duelist 
like Yusyo Sakaki that people will be proud of!

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:11.220
I want to become a duelist that will 
make me and everyone love dueling!

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:34.620
Excellent!  Yuya's player's oath 
represents their determination!

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:42.600
Well said, Yuya!

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:49.540
Yoko, Yuya is clearly trying to catch 
up to the great duelist Yusyo Sakaki!

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.050
You must be joking.

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:55.250
He won't catch up to him.  
He will surpass Yusyo Sakaki.

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:56.720
Yoko...

00:17:57.500 --> 00:18:01.620
Without that amount of fighting 
spirit, he can't win.

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:06.910
I'll announce the first round matchups!

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:11.700
Duelists, insert your registration 
cards into your Duel Disks!

00:18:12.160 --> 00:18:14.600
Is this the registration card?

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:16.940
We received it before we entered.

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:22.410
The tournament management computer transmits 
special signals to your registration cards

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:24.950
to inform you of your opponent.

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:29.920
As you win, your opponent will be updated.

00:18:30.180 --> 00:18:32.820
This is useful.  All right!

00:18:33.890 --> 00:18:36.360
My opponent is...

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:40.130
Sawatari!

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:41.870
My opponent is...

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:43.640
Masumi?

00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:46.280
My match is tomorrow.

00:18:46.280 --> 00:18:48.080
Mine is today in the afternoon.

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:49.560
I'm tomorrow.

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:51.740
Gongenzaka!

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:54.180
Who's your opponent?

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:57.120
Ankokuji!

00:18:57.480 --> 00:18:59.700
This is destiny.

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:02.720
My match is right after the ceremonies.

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:04.280
And I'm after that!

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:08.060
Okay then!  We'll cheer for 
Futoshi, Ayu and Yuzu today!

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:09.420
What about you, Sora?

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:12.920
Tomorrow.  My opponent is from LDS.

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:14.900
LDS?  Who?

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:15.530
Well...

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:18.800
Syun Kurosaki.

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:21.740
It's that guy.

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:29.020
So his name is Syun Kurosaki.

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:32.760
Yuzu Hiiragi, it seems you're my opponent.

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:34.660
Masumi?

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:36.340
Masumi, tell me!

00:19:36.340 --> 00:19:39.630
Why is Syun Kurosaki a member of LDS?

00:19:40.100 --> 00:19:41.710
What are you talking about?

00:19:41.710 --> 00:19:44.360
He's been our teammate from the start.

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:47.070
From the start?

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:52.100
Sora Shiunin...

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:56.240
On the third court, it's 
a first round Junior match

00:19:56.560 --> 00:20:03.550
between You Show School's Futoshi Harada 
and Smiling Duel School's Takeshi Shimizu!

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:06.320
Futoshi!  Hang in there!

00:20:06.320 --> 00:20:07.520
Futoshi!

00:20:07.820 --> 00:20:09.760
Takeshi, fight!

00:20:09.760 --> 00:20:10.720
Go go!

00:20:11.200 --> 00:20:12.940
Here I go!  Let's battle!

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:16.520
Red Mask attacks Doodle Beast - Stego!

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:19.730
Takeshi attacks with his ace monster!

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.200
I activate my trap!

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:23.260
Doodlebook - Uh uh uh!

00:20:23.260 --> 00:20:26.040
It stops your attack 
against a Doodle monster!

00:20:27.570 --> 00:20:29.810
Futoshi!  Well done!

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:32.550
I end my turn.

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:35.750
I'll make you shiver!  My turn!

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:37.450
All right!

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:43.840
I can tribute one Doodle Beast to 
Tribute Summon Level 8 Tyranno!

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:47.000
I tribute Doodle Beast - Stego!

00:20:49.780 --> 00:20:54.670
Junior Class's Solid Vision 
is very soft, like a sponge.

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:57.200
Come, Doodle Beast - Tyranno!

00:21:00.340 --> 00:21:01.240
Futoshi!

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:02.370
You're cool!

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:04.300
Tyranno's effect activates!

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:08.780
When it's Tribute Summoned, one 
of your monsters is destroyed.

00:21:09.320 --> 00:21:13.800
And my monster gains half its attack 
points until the end of this turn!

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:17.140
Let's battle!  Tyranno attacks you directly!

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:23.600
I got shivers!

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:29.170
The match is done!  The 
winner is Futoshi Harada!

00:21:29.840 --> 00:21:31.840
I did it!

00:21:32.820 --> 00:21:34.660
Well done, Futoshi!

00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:37.120
It's You Show School's first victory!

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:38.740
I got shivers, Futoshi!

00:21:39.140 --> 00:21:40.380
Piece of cake!

00:21:40.720 --> 00:21:42.480
Don't lose focus, Futoshi.

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:45.840
There's a saying: "Win and tighten 
the straps of your helmet.”

00:21:45.840 --> 00:21:49.780
It warns winners to learn from the defeated-

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:51.920
Gon, you sound like an old geezer.

00:21:51.920 --> 00:21:53.360
Don't call me geezer!

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:55.300
You're next, Ayu.

00:21:55.300 --> 00:21:58.630
Yeah!  My opponent is from LDS.

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:00.280
LDS?

00:22:11.530 --> 00:22:17.010
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:17.230 --> 00:22:26.490
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:33.380 --> 00:22:38.500
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:43.740
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:44.030 --> 00:22:49.180
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:49.430 --> 00:22:54.410
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:54.640 --> 00:23:00.040
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:00.040 --> 00:23:04.460
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:10.430
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:10.430 --> 00:23:15.840
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:15.840 --> 00:23:21.140
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:21.140 --> 00:23:30.480
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:38.730
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:44.360 --> 00:23:48.400
My deck, please let me draw good cards!

00:23:48.400 --> 00:23:50.700
Ayu is full of fighting spirit.

00:23:50.700 --> 00:23:54.230
It's because I won in a way 
that made everyone shiver.

00:23:54.230 --> 00:23:57.350
It's only natural because she's 
in the Junior Tournament.

00:23:57.350 --> 00:24:00.330
Huh?  What's wrong with her opponent?

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:03.100
It's like he's afraid of something.

00:24:03.100 --> 00:24:05.290
Afraid?  Of what?

00:24:05.290 --> 00:24:09.800
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Ayu's Entertainment Aquarium

00:24:09.800 --> 00:24:11.860
The fun is only getting started!
